desc(
	mode: "source"
	language: "ruby"
	title: "源码扫描：Ruby html_safe / raw"
	title_zh: "源码扫描：Ruby html_safe / raw"
	type: vuln
	level: high
	rule_id: "source-ruby-html-safe"
	risk: "xss"
	cwe: "CWE-79"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
html_safe 和 raw 会把字符串标记为已安全，跳过模板转义。

该语言还没有 struct/ssa 前端。source 规则用正则扫描源码，builtin verify 会检查内嵌样例。

### 风险类型
xss

### 影响
命中说明文件中出现了该危险写法。

### 检测方式
源码模式正则匹配。
### 参考
- CWE-79
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
不要对外部数据调用 html_safe。需要 HTML 时用白名单净化库。
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://bad.rb": <<<POS
def bad(s); s.html_safe; end

POS
	"safefile://ok.rb": <<<NEG
def ok(s); s.to_s; end

NEG
)
${*.rb}.pattern_regex(/\.html_safe|raw\s*\(/) as $hit
alert $hit for {
	level: "high",
	title: "源码扫描：Ruby html_safe / raw",
	title_zh: "源码扫描：Ruby html_safe / raw",
	message: "源码扫描：Ruby html_safe / raw",
	risk: "xss",
}
